### 5. Section - Quản lý section và trang

#### Các thuộc tính của Section:

**Margins (Lề):**
```python
from docx.shared import Inches

section = document.sections[0]

# Đặt lề
section.left_margin = Inches(1)
section.right_margin = Inches(1)
section.top_margin = Inches(1)
section.bottom_margin = Inches(1)
```

**Page size (Kích thước trang):**
```python
section.page_width = Inches(8.5)
section.page_height = Inches(11)
```

**Orientation (Hướng trang):**
```python
from docx.enum.section import WD_ORIENTATION

section.orientation = WD_ORIENTATION.LANDSCAPE
section.orientation = WD_ORIENTATION.PORTRAIT
```

**Header và Footer:**
```python
# Header
header = section.header
header_para = header.paragraphs[0]
header_para.text = "Header text"

# Footer
footer = section.footer
footer_para = footer.paragraphs[0]
footer_para.text = "Footer text"

# First page header/footer
section.different_first_page_header_footer = True
first_header = section.first_page_header
first_footer = section.first_page_footer

# Even page header/footer
from docx.enum.section import WD_HEADER_FOOTER
even_header = section.even_page_header
even_footer = section.even_page_footer

# Kiểm tra header/footer có linked to previous không
if header.is_linked_to_previous:
    print("Header uses previous section's header")
else:
    print("Header has its own definition")

# Thay đổi linked status
header.is_linked_to_previous = True  # Link to previous
header.is_linked_to_previous = False  # Use own definition
```

**Header/Footer distance:**
```python
section.header_distance = Inches(0.5)
section.footer_distance = Inches(0.5)
```

**Gutter:**
```python
# Gutter là khoảng cách thêm vào lề trong để đảm bảo lề đều sau khi đóng sách
section.gutter = Inches(0.5)
section.gutter = None  # Xóa gutter
```

**Start type:**
```python
from docx.enum.section import WD_SECTION_START

section.start_type = WD_SECTION_START.NEW_PAGE
section.start_type = WD_SECTION_START.ODD_PAGE
section.start_type = WD_SECTION_START.EVEN_PAGE
```

